#[
#set par(justify:true);
#strong[Undead Vision:] You gain #emph[low-light vision],
as-well-as #emph[lifesense].

#strong[Void Healing:] The is not healed by healing vitality
effects, but is healed by void effects that heal undead.

#strong[Immunity to Death Effects:] You're immune to death
effects. This keeps you from being automatically killed or
from having your dying value automatically increase, but it
doesn't make you immune to other parts of the spell or
effect.

#strong[Disease and Poison Protection:] Immune against
disease and poison.

#strong[Paralysis and Sleep Protection:] You gain a +2
circumstance bonus to saving throws (or any other defense)
against effects that would make you paralyzed or have the
sleep trait.

#strong[Damage Vulnerability:] Weakness 5 to fire and cold
iron based damage.

#strong[Damage Protection:] Resistance 5 to cold/ice and
water based damage.

#strong[Void Aura:] Due to the mummies unique creation
process, it in engulfed by a faint purple-ish void aura. The
aura grants a +1 circumstance bonus to recognize the mummy
as being undead, as well as to detect it in low-light or
darkness conditions. #emph[Lifesense] will reveal the mummy
as an #emph[void-infused undead].

]

